{"id":68885,"date":"2026-07-28T17:28:57","date_gmt":"2026-07-28T16:28:57","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=68885"},"modified":"2026-09-28T20:47:30","modified_gmt":"2026-09-28T19:47:30","slug":"utmb-mont-blanc","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/utmb-mont-blanc\/","title":{"rendered":"UTMB Mont-Blanc 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">UTMB Mont-Blanc 2027<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>UTMB Mont-Blanc 2027<\/strong> (HOKA UTMB Mont-Blanc) realiza-se de <strong>23 a 29 de agosto de 2027<\/strong>, com epicentro na m\u00edtica vila alpina de <strong>Chamonix<\/strong>, em Fran\u00e7a. Considerada a final mundial do circuito UTMB World Series e o \u00e1pice absoluto do trail running mundial, a prova re\u00fane a elite planet\u00e1ria e mais de 10.000 atletas de 100 nacionalidades em torno do maci\u00e7o do Monte Branco, atravessando Fran\u00e7a, It\u00e1lia e Su\u00ed\u00e7a.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A semana de competi\u00e7\u00e3o acolhe as m\u00edticas finais mundiais: a prova rainha <strong>UTMB (171 km e +10.000m D+)<\/strong> com partida na sexta-feira \u00e0s 18h00 na Place du Triangle de l&#8217;Amiti\u00e9, a <strong>CCC (100 km e +6.100m D+)<\/strong> com in\u00edcio em Courmayeur, e a <strong>OCC (55 km e +3.500m D+)<\/strong> a partir de Orsi\u00e8res. O programa inclui ainda os desafios \u00e9picos da <strong>TDS (145 km)<\/strong>, da equipa <strong>PTL (300 km)<\/strong> e a explosiva <strong>ETC (15 km)<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A realiza\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 a cargo do <strong>UTMB Group<\/strong>, oferecendo seguran\u00e7a alpina integral, cronometragem por sat\u00e9lite LiveTrail, postos de socorro avan\u00e7ados e a lend\u00e1ria rece\u00e7\u00e3o de finalistas no arco de Chamonix.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapsho